Evidence for a component selection and its alternatives (@mech-component-evidence: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mechanical-engineering, #source "../sources/FUNdaMENTALS-of-Design-Slocum.lingua#r_58Q6VQJ3FXXGXRBJ3DK0AVC3WQ", #source "../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7", #source "../sources/Rolling-Bearings-SKF.lingua#r_2TAPCQAW8KE8F4YAHNE20HCQYY", #mechanical-engineering "Advanced-study-of-a-transmission-shaft-and-bearing-system.lingua#r_73T6XM2GFFB5SCE4ECK5J1EBAD", #mechanical-engineering "Advanced-study-of-a-precision-mechanism-and-its-errors.lingua#r_622HG8157EVRX1HBNJC391HZ77", #mechanical-engineering "Advanced-study-of-joints-retained-load-and-maintenance.lingua#r_3BFV1HYS3SGQ3NFS6XDM87XY92") { r_0WQRGZJAWX0CXZ9EK3KKKKV747
**Read:** Complete the relevant [FUNdaMENTALS of Design — Alexander Slocum](../sources/FUNdaMENTALS-of-Design-Slocum.lingua#r_58Q6VQJ3FXXGXRBJ3DK0AVC3WQ) topics and [Elements of Mechanical Design — MIT 2.72, Spring 2009](../sources/Elements-of-Mechanical-Design-MIT-2-72.lingua#r_31S9Z88TMF2875BF5KA5825GX7) exercises. For bearing choices, follow the full [Rolling bearings — SKF, 2018](../sources/Rolling-Bearings-SKF.lingua#r_2TAPCQAW8KE8F4YAHNE20HCQYY) selection sequence and the chosen family's actual data, not only the life equation.

Present the requirement, candidate arrangements, load histories, calculations, dimensional interfaces and evidence for one selection. Every number needs a physical definition and operating condition. Separate measured data, published ratings, assumed values and calculated results. A selection remains revisable when a service observation contradicts an assumption.

**Demonstrate:** Check at least two plausible mechanisms for the same useful function. Compare force/motion behavior, stiffness, energy, life mechanisms, supply requirements, assembly, maintenance and uncertainty. Reproduce one nontrivial source calculation independently and show a limiting-case check. Include a failed or rejected alternative and the specific evidence that changed the decision.

Continue into three studies below. They may use the same machine and share calculations or observations; their questions differ. One examines a power transmission, another a precision motion, and the third the joints and maintenance condition that let the assembly retain its function.

**Return:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design](../Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R).
**Continue:** [Advanced study of a transmission, shaft and bearing system](Advanced-study-of-a-transmission-shaft-and-bearing-system.lingua#r_73T6XM2GFFB5SCE4ECK5J1EBAD).

**Continue:** [Advanced study of a precision mechanism and its errors](Advanced-study-of-a-precision-mechanism-and-its-errors.lingua#r_622HG8157EVRX1HBNJC391HZ77).

**Continue:** [Advanced study of joints, retained load and maintenance](Advanced-study-of-joints-retained-load-and-maintenance.lingua#r_3BFV1HYS3SGQ3NFS6XDM87XY92).

